sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Dispatcher
  participant E as Engine
  participant L as SQLite ledger
  participant C as Google Calendar
  participant S as Slack
  participant G as Gmail
  D->>E: POST approve plan
  E->>C: list events on every tech calendar
  E->>E: fingerprint fresh snapshot and compare to plan
  alt fingerprint changed
    E->>L: status stale, nothing written
    E-->>D: plan is stale, re-plan needed
  else fingerprint matches
    E->>L: status executing
    E->>L: mark cal+ J102 pending
    E->>C: insert event with deterministic id
    C-->>E: 201 created or 409 already exists
    E->>L: mark cal+ J102 done
    E->>S: find_by_key then post route with metadata
    E->>G: find_by_key then send with SS tag and header
    E->>C: read all calendars back
    E->>E: check_schedule on real placements
    E-->>D: 36 of 36 checks passed
  end
